{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_01",
  "title": "化物",
  "storyCode": "IW-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "94585cddbcbdeade0361c349bc05590e42fe35d49943626511c0772f6dff2f80",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？怎么停下了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莫不是刚才我出手太重，不小心伤了姑娘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼，会点花里胡哨的功夫，得意什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然已经被那江洋大盗跑了，再和你纠缠也没有什么意义，你这种——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——你叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乌有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，哪有贼人会自报姓名的，想必是什么江湖名号吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，您真聪明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我要是接着追，你是不是就不打算让开了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然怎么说您聪明呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......还敢嘴硬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还愣着干什么！一起上啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小姐！我们来帮忙了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——慢着！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里怎么说也是客栈的地儿，二位再这么闹下去，疮痍满目，白给路人看笑话，怕是不太妥当。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，二位打得精彩，给我们这些人开了眼界，赔偿呢......我就不要了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但现在还请给我一个薄面，今天就先算了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对不住了，掌柜的。事后解开误会，我们自会登门道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......看在掌柜的面子上，这次就放过你吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不知道你们和他是什么关系，劝你们好自为之，乖乖把他交出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是包庇他，你们就都是同罪。放过你一时无妨，但尚蜀容不下你们这样的法外之徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真要是法外之徒，报警就是了，杜小姐何必私下动武呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乌有兄弟说的是，再怎么占理，也不该一言不合就动起手来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这位小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "让你的人退下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小、小姐，就这么放走他......？抓着他一个，等着那个龙门人上钩——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......别嚷嚷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反正那个龙门人已经跑了，留住这一个也没多大用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......再说了，当真能留得住吗？你是不是还有什么手段没使？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有的事，和气生财，和气生财。既然这位小姐愿意退一步，那是再好不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乌有，我记住你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "贵人多忘事，但愿您别记着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（悄悄地，悄悄地......好，这个距离差不多能冲出去了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是卖郑老头一个面子，出了这道门槛，看谁还能保得住你。不如趁现在老老实实听本小姐的话——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——喂！人呢！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他、他怎么就这么跑没影了！？你们在做什么！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......呃......是小姐您刚才也没说到底要不要放走他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......愣着干什么！追啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是、是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......杜大小姐哎，您闹得是不是太大了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你让开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，欸，别——得了，家务事我可管不了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "郑老头！你刚才为什么无动于衷，反而还要拦着我！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......胡闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么胡闹！你不是明知道他们会往应峰路走，才在这里等着他们的吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "城里几十家客栈酒楼都是我们的眼线，要抓一个不知轻重的小贼不是轻而易举——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不知轻重的是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不知道那只酒盏是什么物件，你更不知道刚才那龙门人，到底是什么来头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "何况刚才有高人在场。如果他们真铁了心把事情闹大，赢的会是他们，占理的也会是他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是什么？你知道这一纸委托，到底几斤几两？那位佚名主顾，又是怎样一位人物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凭你也想丢镖局的脸吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好像没人追来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对不住各位，本来该是我领路的，却落得如此田地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我也实在是没想到，到了尚蜀城内，竟然还能遇上这种事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "留那小伙子一个人，真没问题吗？咱们这算不算坑了他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个老板和那位盛气凌人的小姐怕是认识。留下殿后的那位好汉，恐怕没那么容易脱身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么......鲤先生怎么知道的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那姑娘分明几次都在留意掌柜的一举一动，我不会看走眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看走眼，生意就没法做了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只能相信小乌有的逃跑速度了，这点我倒是对他有信心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......真没事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没事。那个女孩也不敢在光天化日之下做什么出格举动吧？虽然人少，可那会儿里里外外，还是有一些路人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......呼，能在这里遇见你们罗德岛，真是巧合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲤先生怎么会来尚蜀？是事务所的委托？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算是吧，不过只是一个老朋友委托给我的私事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是那只盒子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可这真是奇了怪了，在这尚蜀城内，竟然还有人敢抢梁大人的东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不奇怪。如果能安安稳稳抵达尚蜀，梁大人又何苦特地找我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁大人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我一位老同学......你就当是尚蜀的魏彦吾就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔啊......魏先生啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......听这口气，各位与龙门魏公是熟识？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "平头百姓也就罢了，可想在龙门混口饭吃的人，有几个不熟知魏公？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "认识魏公，和魏公认识，是两码事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "确是如此，不过我和魏彦吾的那点孽缘，就先不提了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉。可惜，我是结识不了魏公那般人物了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......了不起是了不起，但也没有那么了不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么说，那位梁大人岂不是个大人物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能算大人物吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算，怎么不算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "慢着，你这话的意思是龙门魏公不算，还是梁大人不算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就算吧，如今都是个大人物了，啧啧啧。当年还只是个不懂变通的愣头青呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......鲤先生倒还是老样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，我在龙门讨日子，和他一个尚蜀大官有多大关系？很久没联系啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快瞧，是那小伙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小乌有！你没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎哟哟哟，别动，别动，浑身疼，浑身疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩人哪，你是有所不知啊，刚才那丫头片子耍起疯劲来那叫一个狠，我使了浑身解数才勉强招架，趁着掌柜拉架的空当，赶紧开溜啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......看你跑过来的模样，分明就没受伤嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "扇子都收在手里，哪使出浑身解数了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......瞒不过恩人......不过太久没大张旗鼓地动过手了，确实有些抽筋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这位小兄弟是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "干员乌有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然还没正式入职，不过我那一颗鞠躬尽瘁的心，已经在罗德岛跳动久矣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来是新入职的干员朋友，幸会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您好您好，听恩人说，您也是罗德岛的合作方？哎，不愧是罗德岛，广结善缘，深得人心，能结交到您这样的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "叫我老鲤就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲤兄客气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，兄弟你刚才说，那位掌柜拉架，你才有机会跑出来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正是，怎么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯......看来事情也没那么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别站在这聊天了，人多眼杂，要是再出什么岔子，我可担待不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我们直接去梁府吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些朋友......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁大人只交代了让我接你，带这么多人过去是不是有点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想来梁大人也不是那么小家子气的人，各位刚才也帮了咱们一把，就一起去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁府啊......其实我们也不该去打搅别人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没关系，有我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲤兄这话爽利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好......既然决定了，那就快点走，这边，来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲤兄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？啊......我马上就来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是什么......尚蜀难道流行这样古怪的宠物吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲤兄！快跟上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......来了，这就来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_306_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
